@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 55
title Off-chain components: thin gateway and existing SSH enforcement
top to bottom direction

package "Browser (planned)" #EAF2FF {
  component "Owner dashboard\nPurchase / renew / delegate" as Dashboard #EAF2FF
  component "Login page + wallet\nSign exact challenge bytes" as Wallet #EAF2FF
}
component "OpenSSH client" as Client #EAF2FF

node "Web service (planned)" #EAF7ED {
  component "Frontend hosting" as Frontend #EAF7ED
  component "Authentication gateway\n/v1/sessions API" as Gateway #EAF7ED
  collections "In-memory sessions\nChallenge + optional proof + expiry" as Sessions #EAF7ED
}
node "Prepared Linux server (implemented)" #FFF0D9 {
  component "OpenSSH / Linux-PAM" as SSHD #FFF0D9
  component "pam_solana.so" as PAM #FFF0D9
  component "solana-authd\nSignature + access verification" as AuthD #FFF0D9
  artifact "server.toml\nRoot-owned mode 0600" as Config #FFF8EA
  artifact "journald\nRedacted login decisions" as Audit #FFF8EA
}
cloud "Solana RPC" as RPC #EDE4FF

Dashboard --> Frontend : Load UI
Wallet --> Frontend : Load signing page
Wallet --> Gateway : Fetch bytes / submit proof
Gateway --> Sessions : Short-lived relay state
Client --> SSHD : SSH
SSHD --> PAM : PAM authentication
PAM <--> AuthD : Root-only Unix socket
AuthD --> Config : Read local identity / endpoints
AuthD --> Audit : Record allow / deny
AuthD --> Gateway : Authenticated publication,\npolling, cleanup
AuthD --> RPC : Finalized access reads
Dashboard --> RPC : Signed transactions;\nfinalized receipts / access

note bottom of Gateway
  No login authorization or billing API.
  Restart loses pending relay sessions.
end note
note bottom of AuthD
  Existing PAM/daemon protocol stays unchanged.
  Console recovery is independent of wallet login.
end note
@enduml
